                                                <div class="col-md-5 text-column1">
                <h5><strong><span class="bw-md text-gradient-x"><span style="color: #ff0061;">Pre-trade</span></span></strong></h5>
<h3><span class="bw-md" style="color: #000000;"><strong>Real-time limit checking</strong></span></h3>
<h3><span class="bw-md" style="color: #000000;"><strong>for total trade certainty</strong></span></h3>
